                </p>
                <br />
                <h2>Mathematics</h2>
                <p>Linear Algebra, Category Theory, Combinator Theory</p>
                <br />
                <h2>Other</h2>
                <p>Conlanging, Sleeping, Physics, Electronics</p>
            </div>
            <div id="contact" class="content-section">
                <h2>Contact</h2>
                <p>
                    Email: <a
                        href="mailto:zhaoxiuya13@gmail.com"
                        rel="noopener noreferrer">zhaoxiuya13@gmail.com</a
                    >
                </p>
                <p>
                    School Email: <a
                        href="mailto:zhaoxiuya13@dimigo.hs.kr"
                        rel="noopener noreferrer">zhaoxiuya13@dimigo.hs.kr</a
                    >
                </p>
                <p>
                    ORCID: <a
                        href="https://orcid.org/0009-0004-1393-2031"
                        target="_blank"
                        rel="noopener noreferrer">0009-0004-1393-2031</a
                    >
                </p>
                <p>
                    LinkedIn: <a
                        href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/zhaoxiuya/"
                        target="_blank"
                        rel="noopener noreferrer">Sua Tso</a
                    >
                </p>
                <br />
                <h2>Other</h2>
                <p>
                    Github: <a
                        href="https://github.com/zhaoxiuya"
                        target="_blank"
                        rel="noopener noreferrer">zhaoxiuya</a
                    >
                </p>
                <p>
                    BOJ: <a
                        href="https://www.acmicpc.net/user/zhaoxiuya"
                        target="_blank"
                        rel="noopener noreferrer">zhaoxiuya</a
                    >
                </p>
                <p>
                    Codeforces: <a
                        href="https://codeforces.com/profile/zhaoxiuya"
                        target="_blank"
                        rel="noopener noreferrer">zhaoxiuya</a
                    >
                </p>
                <p>
                    Atcoder: <a
                        href="https://atcoder.jp/users/zhaoxiuya"
